{"v":4,"catch":"你能打造最成功的服裝門市嗎？","desc":"Clothes & Outlet Supermarket Store Simulator 是一款真實模擬遊戲，在這裡你將扮演一名企業家，建立自己的時尚帝國！ 經營服裝超市和品牌折扣店，補充庫存、設定價格、設計店鋪，並吸引顧客來發展你的事業。\n\t•\t全面經營 – 選擇銷售商品、與供應商談判，並管理你的庫存。\n\t•\t自訂設計 – 規劃店面布局、打造吸引人的展示，提供獨特的購物體驗。\n\t•\t策略與擴展 – 擴大業務、開設新門市，將你的折扣店發展成成功的零售連鎖品牌。\n\t•\t真實模擬 – 與動態顧客互動、分析流行趨勢，並調整策略以獲得最大利潤。\n準備好成為時尚大亨了嗎？立即在 Clothes & Outlet Supermarket Store Simulator 中開啟你的事業！","publisher":"Great Escape Games Publishing","release":"2025-04-24","genres":["模擬","冒險","派對","訓練"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 1.1GB / Switch 1.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7985a925f6d39b43bd636d7c48d0a057d3a520b0388c8c990445527a99da3e22.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ea333caffe2fd7779b862c498b5f2b631dd3bb46825ecdca543e7002f530c727.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d4ba730195bb8a112b919debefaad6271d435b0a61663e27e0e0269591427001.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f922bfaa4d20c0be989df160207525da7388213dc5dd0f68fb7b9d50dcbab67a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/aa4920181965e1b4ce017b3b3e64f3c3272c837aad0929e8346fd6166a2d7401.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ea24af316e29b2fe8a1504c15e3a5f673ccf92c788973df9ab7d128dd88477cc.jpg"],"titleId":"010093a022ff4000","dlc":[]}